WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.660
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1, B

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.560
<v><b>M:</b></v> I don’t think she’s Australian. But I know a lot of you do.

00:00:09.386 --> 00:00:11.801
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2, D

00:00:13.005 --> 00:00:18.155
<v><b>M:</b></v> I don’t think she’s Australian. I know you think I do, but it’s not true.

00:00:20.135 --> 00:00:22.565
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3, C

00:00:23.635 --> 00:00:26.763
<v><b>M:</b></v> I don’t think she’s Australian. But she might be.

00:00:28.705 --> 00:00:31.069
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4, A

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.751
<v><b>M:</b></v> I don’t think she’s Australian. But I think her husband is.

00:00:37.626 --> 00:00:40.255
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5, E

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:44.980
<v><b>M:</b></v> I don’t think she’s Australian. I think she’s a New Zealander.